
Factory interface create family of product
Factory method create one prouct 

lets say we wanted to create UI framework for different OS

           UIFramework
               |
    -------------------------
    |                       |
WindowsFamily            MacFamily
    |                       |
-----------            -------------
|         |           |            |
Button  Checkbox    Button      Checkbox

First here we need to create interface for each product
Then concrete product as per need (windows and Mac)

Factory interface which will be responsible to create compatible object and this will be used by client
Concrete factory which will be responsible to create specific aksed object 

Here client doesn;t know about concrete product, only knows abstraction
